OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning rules to curb HMOs slated
OL,4,Afor more areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FRules that require shared houses to
OL,7,Fhave planning permission look set to be
OL,8,Fextended amid concerns about a
OL,9,Fproliferation of house conversions.
OL,11,FLandlords in Reading who want to
OL,12,Fconvert houses into homes in multiple
OL,13,Foccupation (HMOs) already face
OL,14,Frestrictions in some parts of the town.
OL,16,FReading Borough Council is now seeking
OL,17,Fto extend the restrictions on permitted
OL,18,Fdevelopment rights to include more
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
