OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning rules to curb HMOs slated
OL,4,Afor more areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf agreed, any small HMO in the new
OL,7,Fzones that houses three to six
OL,8,Funrelated people will require planning
OL,9,Fpermission.
